COLOSSEUM BATTLE ENVIRONMENTS v2.0

Standalone Colosseum battle presentation for Gen1Recomp.

• Source-derived Colosseum arenas, Pokémon models, trainers, camera presentation, MoveFX and battle audio.
• Gen 1 + Gen 2 support with doubles and abilities integration.
• Android GLES compatibility and white-screen recovery: failed arena frames do not hand Gen II back to the stock white-paper battlefield.
• Safe retrying battle host, lightweight mobile shader fallback, color-only framebuffer fallback and isolated arena render-pass recovery.
• Persistent runtime model caching and cache reuse remain supported. Existing compatible generated caches are not invalidated by the v2.0 repackage.
• UI overhaul remains optional and is not embedded in this standalone package.

Requires a user-provided Pokémon Colosseum (USA / GC6E01) source through Gen1Recomp's required-import system. No game disc data is included.
